      ],
      "statement": "China's InP export restrictions ripple through the entire optical supply chain (SemiAnalysis): Lumentum sold out through 2028 despite quadrupling output; Taiwanese epi houses VPEC and LandMark Optoelectronics faced InP substrate disruptions from AXT permit delays.",
      "subject_id": "mat:inp_substrate"
